# Test Directory

This directory is reserved for testing and validation of the Heartbeat Monitor & Alert Embedded System.

## Purpose

The test directory can be used to store:

- Embedded firmware test cases
- Sensor validation tests
- BPM threshold tests
- Alert-condition tests
- Simulation test files
- Automated PlatformIO tests

## Test Conditions

The main alert conditions tested in this project are:

| BPM | Condition | Expected Result |
|---:|---|---|
| 50 | LOW | Red LED + Buzzer |
| 80 | NORMAL | Green LED + Buzzer OFF |
| 120 | HIGH | Red LED + Buzzer |

## Testing Approach

Testing can be performed using:

1. ESP32 hardware with the MAX30102 sensor.
2. Python-based BPM simulation.
3. Graphical heartbeat monitoring simulator.
4. Wokwi circuit simulation.

## Note

This project is intended for educational and embedded-systems demonstration purposes. The test thresholds are demonstration values and are not medical diagnostic limits.